  "description": "Sea water salinity (so) at the surface level from the CMEMS global ocean physics analysis and forecast. Hosted on the USF IMaRS ERDDAP (https://erddap.marine.usf.edu/erddap) and re-served with CORS and Parquet by erddap.oceanmetrics.io, referenced in place for computing place statistics in the browser via griddap.parquet. Variables on the 1-level depth axis are sliced at the surface level (erddap-places:depth = 0.494025 m). Known issue: the values on this dataset are all NaN as re-served (2026-10); use cmems_salinity instead. Not precomputed.",
